<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92324" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rug, blanket</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly in pl. (sg. in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.661
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				118
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. καλά, πορφύρεα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.644
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.297
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιγαλόεντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					6.38
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				11.189
			</span></i>, etc.: used as covering of a bed, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.661
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				24.644
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.349
			</span></i>, etc.; or of a seat, <i><span class="en">
				10.352
			</span></i>; prob. a garment, <i><span class="en">
				6.38
			</span></i>: since, in <i><span class="en">
				13.73
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				118
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> distinguishes <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆγος</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον</span>, it is prob. that the
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆγος</span> was of wool. (from
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῆξαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάψαι</span>
			, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				782.20
			</span></i>, but elsewhere this verb is written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέξαι</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέζω</span>
			 (B).)</div>
